  <Properties>
    <authorBio>
      <Value><![CDATA[Perry Kolator has weighed, ground, bloomed and judged coffee for longer than is sensible, and keeps the receipts in a spreadsheet.
Perry writes The Daily Grind to share what the spreadsheet says, and to apologise to everyone who has been handed a tasting flight without asking.
Current favourite brew: whatever is in the mug right now. Current regret: the second grinder.]]></Value>
